### 글 목록 → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts

### 글 쓰기 → 201
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "영민", "content": "안녕!" }

### 빈 글 → 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "영민", "content": "" }

### 글 지우기 → 204 (위에서 만든 1번 글)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/1

### 없는 글 지우기 → 404
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/999
